# Text files are stored and checked out with LF line endings on every platform, so the
# content package, the feature files, and the scripts are byte-identical everywhere the
# framework installs them (O-16). PowerShell 7 and Go both read LF files without complaint.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary artifacts, never normalised
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.tgz binary
*.exe binary
